# Keep the deployment source (and therefore every Python function bundle)
# small. The serverless index is already baked into api/_index_data.py, so the
# corpus, local FastAPI backend, scripts and docs are not needed on Vercel.
# This replaces a `functions.excludeFiles` rule, which Vercel validates against
# detected functions and can fail a build with `unused_function`.
.git
.workbuddy-ai/
backend/
docs/
scripts/
ragg/
*.ipynb
*.png
*.index
*.npy
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.vercel
